---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const STREAM_ID = '1ea6351125a7e09abc7bde760fbc0b5a';
const STREAM_CUSTOMER = 'https://customer-wa9cpywo3l4jte5c.cloudflarestream.com';
const STREAM_POSTER = `${STREAM_CUSTOMER}/${STREAM_ID}/thumbnails/thumbnail.jpg?time=&height=720`;
const STREAM_HLS = `${STREAM_CUSTOMER}/${STREAM_ID}/manifest/video.m3u8`;
---

<Layout>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-1">
    <section class="hero relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-ink-950" aria-label="ABQWax.ing streaming hero">
      <div class="relative sm:min-h-[min(78vh,760px)]">
        <div class="hero-media relative aspect-[5/6] overflow-hidden sm:absolute sm:inset-0 sm:aspect-auto" aria-hidden="true">
          <video
            id="hero-stream"
            class="hero-video absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
            autoplay
            muted
            loop
            playsinline
            preload="auto"
            poster={STREAM_POSTER}
            data-hls={STREAM_HLS}
          >
            <source src={STREAM_HLS} type="application/x-mpegURL" />
          </video>
          <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink-950/70 via-transparent to-ink-950/10 sm:from-ink-950 sm:from-10% sm:via-ink-950/45 sm:via-40% sm:to-transparent sm:to-70%"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative z-10 flex items-end sm:absolute sm:inset-0">
          <div class="container-narrow w-full pb-8 pt-6 sm:pb-12 sm:pt-28">
            <p class="mb-2 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widestx text-gold-300 sm:mb-3 sm:text-xs">
              Albuquerque · Waxing · Premium Domain
            </p>
            <h1 class="font-display text-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-[0.95] text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
              ABQWax<span class="italic text-gold-300">.ing</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-100/90 sm:mt-5 sm:text-lg">
              The city. The service. The verb. Read it once and it becomes Albuquerque waxing.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-5 flex flex-col gap-2 sm:mt-8 sm:flex-row sm:gap-3">
              <a href="#value" class="btn-primary">Why it is rare</a>
              <a href="#acquisition" class="btn-secondary">$250,000</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <script>
      const video = document.getElementById('hero-stream');
      if (video instanceof HTMLVideoElement) {
        const src = video.dataset.hls;
        const tryPlay = () => {
          video.muted = true;
          video.play().catch(() => {});
        };

        if (src && video.canPlayType('application/vnd.apple.mpegurl')) {
          tryPlay();
        } else if (src) {
          const script = document.createElement('script');
          script.src = 'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/hls.js@1.5.17/dist/hls.min.js';
          script.async = true;
          script.onload = () => {
            // @ts-ignore
            const HlsLib = window.Hls;
            if (HlsLib?.isSupported()) {
              const hls = new HlsLib({ enableWorker: true, lowLatencyMode: false });
              hls.loadSource(src);
              hls.attachMedia(video);
              hls.on(HlsLib.Events.MANIFEST_PARSED, tryPlay);
            } else {
              tryPlay();
            }
          };
          document.head.appendChild(script);
        }

        document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', () => {
          if (!document.hidden) tryPlay();
        });
      }
    </script>

    <section id="name" class="section-padding bg-ink-50">
      <div class="container-narrow max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widestx text-gold-500">The name</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink-950 sm:text-5xl">A domain that speaks the search</h2>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-800 sm:text-base">
          <p>
            Most beauty domains describe a brand. <strong class="text-ink-950">ABQWax.ing</strong> describes the query.
            ABQ is how Albuquerque is written on tickets, weather, and maps. Wax is the category. The <strong class="text-ink-950">.ing</strong> TLD completes the word people actually type and say: <em>waxing</em>.
          </p>
          <p>
            Spoken aloud it is a sentence fragment with commercial intent: Albuquerque waxing. Printed on a window it is a complete identity. Typed into a browser it is the listing they meant to find.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="value" class="section-padding bg-white">
      <div class="container-narrow">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widestx text-gold-500">The value</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink-950 sm:text-5xl">Why this name commands a premium</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-950">Exact-match language</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">
              Local search for this category clusters around “ABQ waxing,” “Albuquerque waxing,” and “Brazilian wax Albuquerque.” The hostname is the first of those phrases, complete.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-950">The .ing advantage</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">
              .ing is not decoration. It supplies the present-tense verb that turns a noun into a service. ABQWax.com is a label. ABQWax.ing is an action.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-950">City-code scarcity</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">
              Three-letter city codes that also work in conversation are scarce. ABQ is already the market’s shorthand. Pairing it with waxing leaves little room for a competitor to own the same phrase.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-950">Brand and asset</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">
              The name works as a studio, a multi-chair group, or a regional platform. It is short enough for a van wrap and precise enough for paid search, maps, and direct type-in traffic.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 rounded-3xl border border-ink-100 bg-ink-950 p-6 text-center sm:p-10">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widestx text-gold-400">Asking price</p>
          <p class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl font-semibold text-gold-300 sm:text-6xl">$250,000</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-100/70">A one-time acquisition for a category-defining Albuquerque name.</p>
          <a href="#acquisition" class="btn-primary mt-6">Request terms</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-padding bg-ink-50">
      <div class="container-narrow grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widestx text-gold-500">The market</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink-950 sm:text-4xl">Albuquerque is the search radius</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-800 sm:text-base">
            Waxing is recurring. Clients return every three to four weeks. A name that already contains the city and the service reduces the cost of being found — on maps, in ads, and by word of mouth.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-800 sm:text-base">
            High-desert heat makes lasting smoothness a practical purchase, not a luxury afterthought. Brazilian and hard-wax work for sensitive areas is the category this domain was built to carry.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-ink-100 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8">
          <dl class="space-y-5">
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-ink-100 pb-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-ink-600">Read aloud</dt>
              <dd class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-950">ABQ waxing</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-ink-100 pb-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-ink-600">Market</dt>
              <dd class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-950">Albuquerque</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-ink-100 pb-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-ink-600">TLD</dt>
              <dd class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-950">.ing</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-ink-600">Offer</dt>
              <dd class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-gold-500">$250,000</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="method" class="section-padding bg-white">
      <div class="container-narrow">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widestx text-gold-500">The craft</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink-950 sm:text-5xl">What the category delivers</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-700 sm:text-lg">
            Wax epilation extracts hair from the root using warm or hard wax, providing smooth skin for 3 to 4 weeks.
            Hard wax is preferred for the bikini line and underarms because it adheres to hair, not skin.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink-950">Lasting result</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">Three to four weeks of smoothness. Recurring demand is built into the service.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink-950">Sensitive areas</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">Hard wax for Brazilian and underarm work — grip on the hair, release from the skin.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink-950">Prep</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">Hair at ¼ to ½ inch. The wait between visits is the model, not a gap.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-padding bg-ink-50">
      <div class="container-narrow">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widestx text-gold-500">The guides</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink-950 sm:text-5xl">Explore the category</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-700 sm:text-lg">
            From the method to the search, read how Albuquerque waxing is described — and how one name can hold it all.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <a href="/albuquerque-waxing/" class="card group transition hover:-translate-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-950 group-hover:text-gold-500">Albuquerque Waxing</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">The category, the method, and the recurring demand behind the search.</p>
            <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-gold-500">Read the guide →</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/brazilian-wax-albuquerque/" class="card group transition hover:-translate-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-950 group-hover:text-gold-500">Brazilian Wax Albuquerque</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">The most searched single service, from prep to aftercare.</p>
            <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-gold-500">Read the guide →</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/hard-wax-albuquerque/" class="card group transition hover:-translate-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-950 group-hover:text-gold-500">Hard Wax Albuquerque</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">Hard wax vs soft wax, and why technique wins for sensitive areas.</p>
            <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-gold-500">Read the guide →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-8 text-center text-sm text-ink-700">
          More in <a href="/insights/" class="font-medium text-gold-500 underline-offset-4 hover:underline">the insights library</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t border-ink-100 bg-ink-50 py-10 sm:py-12">
      <div class="container-narrow text-center">
        <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-600 sm:text-sm">
          Information presented is for demonstration and educational purposes only and does not constitute an offer of salon services.
          The domain is offered at the stated asking price; terms are subject to a written agreement.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
